content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Scout",
      "description": "An individual employed by the club to identify and evaluate potential players."
    },
    {
      "name": "Scouting Trip",
      "description": "A trip organized for scouts to observe players during matches or training sessions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Player",
      "description": "An athlete who may be evaluated, recruited, or contracted by the club."
    },
    {
      "name": "Performance Report",
      "description": "A detailed record of a player's performance in a match or event, created by a scout.",
      "attributes": [
        "Player"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Scouting Report",
      "description": "A compiled document summarizing scouting findings, including performance reports and evaluations.",
      "attributes": [
        "Player",
        "Performance Report"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Scouting Coordinator",
      "description": "A club staff member who manages scouting operations and reviews scouting reports."
    },
    {
      "name": "Club",
      "description": "The organization employing scouts, coordinators, and directors to manage recruitment and player relations.",
      "attributes": [
        "Scout",
        "Scouting Coordinator",
        "Sports Director",
        "Watchlist"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sports Director",
      "description": "A senior official responsible for player recruitment decisions and contract negotiations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Watchlist",
      "description": "An internal list of priority players being monitored by the club.",
      "attributes": [
        "Scouting Report"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Player Agent",
      "description": "A representative who manages a player's career, including contracts and negotiations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Contract Proposal",
      "description": "A preliminary document outlining proposed terms of a player contract.",
      "attributes": [
        "Contract"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Evaluation": {
      "objects": [
        "Scouting Coordinator",
        "Sports Director",
        "Club",
        "Watchlist",
        "Scouting Report"
      ]
    },
    "Negotiation": {
      "objects": [
        "Contract Proposal",
        "Player Agent",
        "Contract",
        "Player"
      ]
    },
    "Scouting": {
      "objects": [
        "Scout",
        "Scouting Trip",
        "Performance Report",
        "Player",
        "Scouting Report"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Evaluation": {
      "derived from": "Evaluation Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Scouting Coordinator",
        "Sports Director",
        "Club",
        "Watchlist",
        "Priority Report"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Scouting Report -> Priority Report"
      ]
    },
    "Negotiation": {
      "derived from": "Negotiation Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Contract Proposal",
        "Player Agent",
        "Contract",
        "Player"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Scouting": {
      "derived from": "Scouting Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Scout",
        "Scouting Trip",
        "Performance Report",
        "Prospect",
        "Scouting Report"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Player -> Prospect"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
